  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the red snapper fillet and pat it dry with paper towels.",
    "Mix together minced garlic, chopped parsley, chopped dill, lemon juice, and olive oil in a small bowl.",
    "Season the red snapper fillet with salt and black pepper.",
    "Coat the red snapper fillet with almond flour, shaking off excess.",
    "Place the coated red snapper fillet in the air fryer basket.",
    "Cook the red snapper fillet in the air fryer for 8 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Remove the cooked red snapper fillet from the air fryer and serve it with the garlic-herb mixture.",
    "Sprinkle the garlic-herb mixture over the red snapper fillet and serve immediately."
